# Cross-platform provenance for frozen D2/E01 scientific artifacts.
#
# The project pins exact SHA256 values for several artifacts, and its tooling
# hashes raw file bytes (path.read_bytes() / digest_file()). Examples:
#   - IOR-YOLO/configs/experiments/e01_yolo11n_seg.yaml pins the frozen pool,
#     split and protocol SHAs; re-verified by 15_e01_run.py.load_config() and
#     21_e01_local_engineering.py.verified_formal_config().
#   - IOR-YOLO/configs/data/d2_frozen_protocol.yaml pins frozen_csv_sha256 and
#     records generator_sha256 / supporting_generator_sha256 for the scripts
#     that generated it, plus source_groups_sha256 / relations_sha256.
#   - 16_resolve_e01_config.py records the requested config file SHA.
#
# Git blobs are LF. On Windows the system core.autocrlf=true rewrites text files
# to CRLF at checkout, so the worktree bytes no longer match the frozen LF SHAs
# even though the committed blobs are unchanged. That produces false
# "frozen artifact changed" failures and breaks D2 rebuild determinism checks.
# Forcing LF for every hashed path keeps worktree bytes byte-identical to the
# canonical Git blobs on macOS, Linux and Windows.
#
# Scope: scripts + manifests + configs, i.e. the files that participate in the
# provenance hash chain. Generated run outputs, images and weights are not
# covered here (they are gitignored or binary).

# Frozen artifacts referenced explicitly by the E01 loaders.
IOR-YOLO/data/manifests/d2_experiment_pool_frozen.csv text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/data/manifests/d2_split_frozen.csv text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/data/manifests/d2_exclusions_frozen.csv text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/configs/data/d2_frozen_protocol.yaml text eol=lf

# Scripts that are hashed (self-hash or supporting-generator hash).
IOR-YOLO/scripts/*.py text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/scripts/**/*.py text eol=lf

# Manifests whose raw bytes are hashed or compared byte-for-byte.
IOR-YOLO/data/manifests/*.csv text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/data/manifests/**/*.csv text eol=lf

# Config files whose raw bytes are hashed (resolved-config provenance).
IOR-YOLO/configs/*.yaml text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/configs/**/*.yaml text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/configs/*.json text eol=lf
IOR-YOLO/configs/**/*.json text eol=lf